  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: enforce fixed libpng at runtime for CVE-2026-25646\n     - debian/control: pin openjdk-8-jre Depends on\n       libpng16-16 (>= 1.6.37-2+tuxcare.els2); libsplashscreen dynamically\n       links the system libpng, so the ELS libpng1.6 rebuild carrying the\n       png_set_quantize heap-overflow fix must be present at install time\n     - CVE-2026-25646\n   * Ref: ELSCVE-134720",
